T1  - First-in-human healthy volunteer dosimetry studies of the excitatory amino acid transporter 2 (EAAT2) PET imaging tracer methyl N4-(7-[18F]fluoro-9H-fluoren-2-yl)asparaginate, [18F]RP-115
AU  - Chao, Chih-Kai
AU  - Blecha, Joseph
AU  - Polvoy, Ilona
AU  - Nillo, Ryan Michael
AU  - Seo, Youngho
AU  - Wilson, David M.
AU  - Forsayeth, John R.
