T1  - Understanding dengue solution and larval indices surveillance system among village health volunteers in high- and low-risk dengue villages in southern Thailand
AU  - Nontapet, Orratai
AU  - Maneerattanasak, Sarunya
AU  - Jaroenpool, Jiraporn
