T1  - Evaluation of proximod, a selective agonist of sphingosine-1-phosphate receptor-1, in healthy volunteers and patients with rheumatoid arthritis: a phase 1, double-blind, randomised, placebo-controlled, ascending dose trial
AU  - Zhang, Hong
AU  - Li, Qianqian
AU  - Li, Cuiyun
AU  - Wu, Min
AU  - Chen, Hong
AU  - Li, Yang
AU  - You, Feng
AU  - Zhao, Yanshi
