T1  - Outpatient PureWick™ female external catheter system performance: Healthy volunteer study
AU  - McRae, Alison Demarco
AU  - Kennelly, Michael
JO  - Continence
VL  - 7
SP  - 100712
PY  - 2023
DA  - 2023/09/01/
